  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      203.45,
      382.34,
      227.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE BATTICALOA YOUNG MEN\u2019SCHRISTIAN\u2019S ASSOCIATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.49,
      401.93,
      316.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Association called and known as the \u201cYoungMen\u2019s Christian\u2019s Association of Batticaloa\u201d has heretoforebeen established at Batticalo for the purpose of achiving theseveral objects and effectually carring out and transactingall matters connected with the said association according tothe rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      330.41,
      401.88,
      367.19
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      381.17,
      401.89,
      405.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      419.33,
      401.85,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Batticaloa Young Men\u2019sChristian\u2019s Association (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      457.37,
      401.93,
      608.39
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members ofthe Batticaloa Young Men\u2019s Christian\u2019s Association ofBatticaloa (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAssociation\u201d)or shall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) with perpetual successionunder the name and style of the Batticaloa YoungMen\u2019s Christian\u2019s Association and by that name maysue and be sued in all courts, with full power and authorityto have and use a common seal and alter the same atits pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      622.49,
      401.92,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted is declared to be the promotion of thespiritual,intellectual, social and physical welfare of all theChildren, Youth and general public of Batticaloa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      458.11,
      455.86,
      515.18
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof the YoungMen\u2019sChristian\u2019sAssociationof Batticaloa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      623.11,
      455.14,
      651.38
    ],
